Wed Nov 18 12:10:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.6: desktop widgets on the wallpaper, under every window: clock,
  Gloxi (suggestions ask it with gloxi-gtk --ask), today's events from
  the GNOME calendar server, the weather from Open-Meteo and the state
  of Копії. The weather is for the capital of the system's country
  unless the person picks a town (search sends only the typed text) or,
  after agreeing, their location rounded to about 10 km (prefs.js).
  New keys widgets, weather and weather-location.
  A live sky behind the weather card (sky.js, lib/weatherSky.js):
  a Vilna gradient and light motion for ten states, including wind
  (gusts from 50 km/h) and heat (feels like 35 °C or more), still
  under a window, in the overview and with animations off.

